    "body": "Opening a file with `nofoldenable` can still compute folds for the entire buffer. `hasFoldingWin()` updates invalid folds before checking whether folding is enabled.\n\nCheck `hasAnyFolding()` first, leaving folds invalid until needed. Add regression tests for expression and syntax folds, including enabling folds with `zc` and `:set foldenable`.\n\nFixes #9084.\n\nValidation:\n- Both new regression tests fail on unmodified master and pass with the fix.\n- Editor folding: 21 tests passed.\n- UI folding: 50 tests passed.\n- Legacy `test_fold`: passed; 4 tests skipped by the harness.\n- C lint and `git diff --check` passed.\n",
